    "updated_at": "2016-10-28T08:20:07Z",
    "body": "> Are there tests for this in wpt? I see /subresource-integrity/subresource-integrity.sub.html for script and style; what about link? \n\n`integrity` does not work on `<style>` tags, just `<link rel=stylesheet>`, as you can see in https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/blob/master/subresource-integrity/subresource-integrity.sub.html#L124-L125. Does that suffice, @zcorpan?\n\n> It would be good to update /html/dom/interfaces.html and the reflection tests also. (Filing an issue to do these is OK too.)\n\nFiled https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/issues/4099\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
