    "created_at": "2016-11-03T10:41:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-03T10:41:17Z",
    "body": "@zcorpan: I see the lack of support for module scripts as a bug in SRI rather than something we should call out as non-conforming in this patch. Likewise, I think the lack of support for anything other than `rel=\"stylesheet\"` as a bug rather than a conformance issue.\n\nI'm willing to mark those as non-conforming in this patch if you think that would improve clarity for developers, but my hope is that @mozfreddyb and the rest of the industrious team of SRI editors will improve the spec and implementations in the (somewhat near?) future.\n\nWDYT?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
